  "prefLabel": "Liq 104.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 104.01 Applicability. The procedures set forth in this section shall apply to all regular and special meetings conducted by the commission and to all matters scheduled to be presented to or heard by the commission at any regular or special meeting that are not rulemaking hearings, adjudicatory hearings, or other hearings addressed in Liq 200.\n\nSource. #12207-A, eff 6-14-17; ss by #13612, eff 4-25-23",
